# Master Prompt Schema: E.V.O. Intelligence-Aware Cursor Prompts

## Overview

Every Execution Assist prompt generated by E.V.O. follows this master schema. The schema extends the current generic, industry-agnostic prompt templates with six intelligence layers: protocol mechanics, E.V.O. diagnostic data, property profile, cohort identity, industry intelligence, and Bayesian fleet intelligence. Sections activate conditionally based on available data — properties with rich Bayesian intelligence get highly specific prompts; properties in sparse cohorts get prompts closer to the current generic templates but still architecture-aware.

## Extended Context Object

The current context object carries protocol mechanics and E.V.O. dimension data. The master schema extends it with the full intelligence layer.

