## Master Prompt Template

Every prompt generated by E.V.O. follows this master structure. Sections activate conditionally based on available data.

```
You are implementing ${stepName} as part of ${mission}.

TARGET PROPERTY PROFILE:
Architecture: ${propertyProfile.architecture.framework} (${propertyProfile.architecture.rendering})
${propertyProfile.architecture.cms ? `CMS: ${propertyProfile.architecture.cms}` : ''}
${propertyProfile.architecture.commerce ? `Commerce: ${propertyProfile.architecture.commerce}` : ''}
Industry: ${cohortIdentity.industry} (${cohortIdentity.businessModel})
Scale: ${cohortIdentity.pageCount} pages (${cohortIdentity.scaleTier})
Maturity: ${cohortIdentity.maturityStage}

${platformConstraints.blockedActions.length > 0 ? `
⚠ PLATFORM CONSTRAINTS:
The following actions are NOT possible on this architecture:
${platformConstraints.blockedActions.map(a => `- ${formatConstraint(a)}`).join('\n')}
${platformConstraints.platformNotes || ''}
Do NOT generate recommendations for blocked actions. Focus only on what is editable in the codebase.
` : ''}

═══════════════════════════════════════════════
OBJECTIVE: ${executionInstructions.action}
═══════════════════════════════════════════════

IMPLEMENTATION FOCUS:
${executionInstructions.implementation}

${protocolSpecificSection}

${evoDataSection || ''}

${bayesianIntelligenceSection || ''}

${industryContextSection || ''}

${implementationInstructionsSection}

DELIVERABLE:
Create ${fileName}
```

