## Protocol-Specific Sections

Each protocol type injects its section between the objective and the implementation instructions. These replace the current generic templates with industry-aware variants.

### Meta Surgeon Protocol — Schema Section

```
SCHEMA IMPLEMENTATION:

${industryIntelligence.schemaRecommendations.length > 0 ? `
INDUSTRY-SPECIFIC SCHEMA PRIORITIES FOR ${cohortIdentity.industry.toUpperCase()}:
${industryIntelligence.schemaRecommendations.map((s, i) => `
${i + 1}. ${s.type} [${s.priority.toUpperCase()}]
   ${s.reason}
`).join('')}

Implement schemas in priority order. Each schema type listed above has demonstrated
measurable impact for ${cohortIdentity.industry} properties in search results.
` : `
SCHEMA TYPE: ${executionInstructions.schemaType}
`}

FRAMEWORK-SPECIFIC IMPLEMENTATION FOR ${propertyProfile.architecture.framework.toUpperCase()}:
${getFrameworkSchemaGuidance(propertyProfile.architecture)}
```

